  "description": "Chicken climber is a challenging vertical platformer where the only way to move is to jump! Guide a determined chicken through tall and unforgiving stages where each jump must be carefully timed and any mistake can send you falling down.\n\nClimb through 8 handcrafted levels, filled with tight platforms, sneaky traps and wide chasms, and test your precision, focus and skill while you try reaching the goal at the very top.\n\nEach level hides a lot of shiny gems and delicious fruits waiting to be discovered. Gather them all to fully complete each level and prove your mastery. Whether you’re aiming to just reach the top or to achieve 100% completion, Chicken Climber rewards perseverance and careful play.\n\n\nFeatures\n* Vertical platformer focused on jumping\n* Climb through 8 tall challenging levels\n* Punishing falls that make every jump matter\n* Find hidden gems across each levels\n* Simple controls, yet challenging gameplay",
